At a certain point Claude is returning code snippets, which then overwrites entire blocks of existing code if you're not paying attention.

Example:

// Keep the existing PHP code unchanged
// ... (previous PHP code remains the same)

It may be super useful to try and detect code snippets and kick out a warning or an error.  Perhaps inject something into the prompt to try and prevent this, or simply make the user super aware of it before they click to accept changes.

